{"id":"5c65f237e17c892c","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-per-cartesian-product.md","title":"Cartesian product of membership PERs","display":"df-per-cartesian-product — Cartesian product of membership PERs","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-per-cartesian-product","aliases":["72-df-per-cartesian-product"],"display":"df-per-cartesian-product — Cartesian product of membership PERs","depends_on":["[[72-df-evaluation-respecting-per]]","[[72-thm-preevaluation-per-lift]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9","source_location":"Chapter X, section 3.9, product membership PER, printed p.746 / PDF p.758","source_statement_checked":true,"verification_status":"definition-contract-checked; source-statement-checked","proof_status":"not-applicable-definition","source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_2026_10_22":"将积关系属于PER与值相容PER的结论移入形式断言"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-per-cartesian-product"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-per-cartesian-product</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-per-cartesian-product — Cartesian product of membership PERs"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d79ea25f75d5218c\" href=\"?note=d79ea25f75d5218c\" title=\"72-df-evaluation-respecting-per\">72-df-evaluation-respecting-per</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b9c13fa158735675\" href=\"?note=b9c13fa158735675\" title=\"72-thm-preevaluation-per-lift\">72-thm-preevaluation-per-lift</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Chapter X, section 3.9, product membership PER, printed p.746 / PDF p.758"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked; source-statement-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_2026_10_22","html":"将积关系属于PER与值相容PER的结论移入形式断言"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d79ea25f75d5218c\" href=\"?note=d79ea25f75d5218c\" title=\"72-df-evaluation-respecting-per\">72-df-evaluation-respecting-per</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak e=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle\">\\(\\mathfrak e=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^{\\Downarrow}\">\\(R^{\\Downarrow}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pair}:T^2\\to T\">\\(\\operatorname{pair}:T^2\\to T\\)</span> 是单射的项构造函数，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pair}(a,b)\\Downarrow\\operatorname{pair}(a,b)\">\\(\\operatorname{pair}(a,b)\\Downarrow\\operatorname{pair}(a,b)\\)</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in T\">\\(a,b\\in T\\)</span> 成立。该构造是惰性数据值，未要求其两个分量先求值。</li>\n<li>下式引入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_{\\alpha,\\beta}\\subseteq T^2\">\\(Q_{\\alpha,\\beta}\\subseteq T^2\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\otimes_{\\mathfrak e}\\beta\\subseteq T^2\">\\(\\alpha\\otimes_{\\mathfrak e}\\beta\\subseteq T^2\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\otimes_{\\mathfrak e}\">\\(\\otimes_{\\mathfrak e}\\)</span> 在此是类型成员关系的积运算。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q_{\\alpha,\\beta}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\operatorname{pair}(a,b),\\operatorname{pair}(a&#39;,b&#39;)\\rangle:\na,a&#39;,b,b&#39;\\in T\\land a\\alpha a&#39;\\land b\\beta b&#39;\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q_{\\alpha,\\beta}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\operatorname{pair}(a,b),\\operatorname{pair}(a&#39;,b&#39;)\\rangle:\na,a&#39;,b,b&#39;\\in T\\land a\\alpha a&#39;\\land b\\beta b&#39;\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\otimes_{\\mathfrak e}\\beta\\coloneqq(Q_{\\alpha,\\beta})^{\\Downarrow}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\alpha\\otimes_{\\mathfrak e}\\beta\\coloneqq(Q_{\\alpha,\\beta})^{\\Downarrow}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q_{\\alpha,\\beta}\\in\\operatorname{PER}(T),\\qquad\\alpha\\otimes_{\\mathfrak e}\\beta\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q_{\\alpha,\\beta}\\in\\operatorname{PER}(T),\\qquad\\alpha\\otimes_{\\mathfrak e}\\beta\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书先构造规范pair值之间的分量相等关系，再作预求值扩张。pair的单射性使中间pair值的分解唯一，确定性保证复合时共享同一个中间值。因此积关系对称且传递；两个Kleene相等的项只要一个求值为pair，另一个也求值为同一pair，故积关系值相容。由此输出仍是成员PER。这是PER语义中的积，和本目录线性逻辑的张量没有依赖关系。</p>\n<p>2026-10-22：原证明中的输出资格现明确写入Assertion。pair单射性给中间值分量一致，Q的对称与传递由两个分量PER得到；预求值扩张的PER与饱和结论由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b9c13fa158735675\" href=\"?note=b9c13fa158735675\" title=\"72-thm-preevaluation-per-lift\">72-thm-preevaluation-per-lift</a> 复用。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-evaluation-respecting-per","status":"resolved","id":"d79ea25f75d5218c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-evaluation-respecting-per]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-preevaluation-per-lift","status":"resolved","id":"b9c13fa158735675","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-preevaluation-per-lift]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-evaluation-respecting-per","status":"resolved","id":"d79ea25f75d5218c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[72-df-evaluation-respecting-per]] 的 $\\mathfrak e=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle$ 与 $R^{\\Downarrow}$。$\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-preevaluation-per-lift","status":"resolved","id":"b9c13fa158735675","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"2026-10-22：原证明中的输出资格现明确写入Assertion。pair单射性给中间值分量一致，Q的对称与传递由两个分量PER得到；预求值扩张的PER与饱和结论由 [[72-thm-preevaluation-per-lift]] 复用。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak e=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"R^{\\Downarrow}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pair}:T^2\\to T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pair}(a,b)\\Downarrow\\operatorname{pair}(a,b)","display":false},{"tex":"a,b\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"Q_{\\alpha,\\beta}\\subseteq T^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\otimes_{\\mathfrak e}\\beta\\subseteq T^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\otimes_{\\mathfrak e}","display":false},{"tex":"Q_{\\alpha,\\beta}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\operatorname{pair}(a,b),\\operatorname{pair}(a',b')\\rangle:\na,a',b,b'\\in T\\land a\\alpha a'\\land b\\beta b'\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha\\otimes_{\\mathfrak e}\\beta\\coloneqq(Q_{\\alpha,\\beta})^{\\Downarrow}.","display":true},{"tex":"Q_{\\alpha,\\beta}\\in\\operatorname{PER}(T),\\qquad\\alpha\\otimes_{\\mathfrak e}\\beta\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e).","display":true}],"bytes":2564,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-409","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-per-cartesian-product|df-per-cartesian-product — Cartesian product of membership PERs]]"},{"id":"5b28d334ba6b8ce1","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak e,T,\\operatorname{pair}$ 采用 [[72-df-per-cartesian-product]] 的惰性单射对构造。$\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)$，$\\Phi:|\\alpha|\\to\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)$，且 $a\\alpha a'\\Rightarrow\\Phi(a)=\\Phi(a')$。"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-407","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[df-per-cartesian-product — Cartesian product of membership PERs](72-df-per-cartesian-product.md)"},{"id":"2e1cc33090ad6f68","anchor":"ref-41","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-per-cartesian-product]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-443","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-per-cartesian-product|df-per-cartesian-product — Cartesian product of membership PERs]]"},{"id":"0516e51f5ae8a319","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"α、β、pair、$\\mathfrak e$ 取 [[72-df-per-cartesian-product]]，$R:=\\alpha\\otimes_{\\mathfrak e}\\beta$；类与商取 [[72-df-partial-equivalence-relation]]。$a\\in|\\alpha|$、$b\\in|\\beta|$。"},{"id":"f6f38fb4ec14b41d","anchor":"ref-41","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-per-cartesian-product]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-194","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-per-cartesian-product]]"}],"outgoing":["d79ea25f75d5218c","b9c13fa158735675"]}